     <p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 93.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 1.22in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 7.8pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2023</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年绍兴一中高一新生军训方案</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.4%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 3.25pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一、指导思想</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.4%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 3.25pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">为贯彻落实《教育部、中央军委国防动员部关于印发 <高中阶段学校学生军事训练教学 大纲>》的精神，为了增强高一新生的国防意识，磨练学生的意志，让学生接触军营，了解 军人，体验部队训练和生活，培养学生爱国主义、集体主义精神，激发学生积极向上、奋发 进取的热情，从而使学生具有严明的组织纪律性，养成良好的学习、生活、卫生习惯。学校 决定对高一新生进行为期</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">七</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">天的军训，特制定本方案。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.6pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二、训练内容</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.6pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in;">1.基本军事知识学习：人民军队、现代国防、军兵种知识。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.6pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in;">2.基本军事技能训练：单兵队列动作、队列队形训练、军语标准化、分列式。 </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.6pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in;">3.急救技能培训、消防灭火培训、紧急逃生演练。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.6pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in;">4.军旅文化学习：内务整理、仪容仪表、国防教育、军旅歌曲。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.6pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in;">5.团队表演科目：军体拳。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.15pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.45pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三、组织领导</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.15pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in;">组  长： 王  琛</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.15pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in;">副组长：孙洪亮</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 95.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.09in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 6.15pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">成  员：蒋明、俞奇弘、刘明玉、何隽豪、王佩金、茹奕蓓、冯王亮、孟德超、王月琴；</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.3in; letter-spacing: 0.35pt;">高一各班班主任；医务（范国娟、魏杲）。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Arial', 'sans-serif';font-size: 10pt;line-height: 18.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.10in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 5.7pt;text-align: left;vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.05pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;">四、时间安排：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.05pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;">2023</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.05pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;">年</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.05pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;">8</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.05pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;">月</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.05pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;">24 日——2023</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.05pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;">年</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.05pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;">8</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;position: relative;top: -5.5pt;"> </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10pt;letter-spacing: 0.